Datasheet 1 — Solmery Power SM-125K-3P
Solmery Power, Inc.
Commercial Three-Phase String Inverter Product Line
Datasheet Ref. SM-125K-3P · Document DS-SM125-R7 · Publication date 02/2025
Solmery Power, Inc. · 1900 Highfield Industrial Drive · Aurora, Illinois 60506 · United States
Product Support: (630) 555-0182 · support@solmerypower.com · solmerypower.com
Product Description
The Solmery Power SM-125K-3P is a transformerless, three-phase commercial string inverter engineered for
behind-the-meter and front-of-the-meter commercial and industrial photovoltaic installations. The unit is intended
for outdoor pad-mount or wall-mount deployment and is designed for 480 V wye grid interconnection on
secondary distribution systems.
Nameplate — AC Output
Nameplate AC output power (continuous, rated) 125 kW
Nameplate AC output power (peak, £10 s) 130 kW
Nominal AC output voltage 480 V, 3-phase, 4-wire (wye) + PE
AC output voltage operating range 422 V – 528 V (–12 % / +10 %)
Nominal output frequency 60 Hz
Output frequency operating range 57.0 – 62.0 Hz (adjustable per utility)
Nominal AC output current, continuous 150.4 A per phase
Maximum AC output current 156.4 A per phase
Power factor at rated power Unity (adjustable 0.80 leading – 0.80 lagging)
Total harmonic distortion (current, at rated output) < 3 %
Inrush current < 20 A peak
Utility interconnection topology Three-phase, four-wire, transformerless
DC Input
Maximum recommended PV field DC input power 187.5 kW (1.50× DC/AC)
Absolute maximum DC input voltage (Voc, cold) 1,100 V DC
MPPT voltage range, full-power 550 V – 950 V DC
MPPT voltage range, operating 200 V – 1,000 V DC
Startup DC voltage 250 V DC
Number of independent MPP trackers 6
DC inputs per MPPT 4 (24 total; fused positive and negative)
Maximum input current per MPPT 40 A
Maximum short-circuit input current per MPPT 60 A
Reverse polarity protection Yes (integrated)
Integrated DC disconnect Yes, load-break rated
Type II surge protection (DC side) Yes, integrated
