Datasheet 2 — Torvane Electric TE-125K
Torvane Electric Corporation
Commercial PV Inverter Division
Datasheet Ref. TE-125K · Document DTS-TE125-Rev4 · Publication date 11/2024
Torvane Electric Corporation · 2440 Merlan Way, Building 4 · Beaverton, Oregon 97006 · United States
Technical Support: (503) 555-0219 · techsupport@torvane-electric.com · torvane-electric.com
Product Description
The Torvane Electric TE-125K is a commercial-grade transformerless three-phase string inverter for grid-parallel
photovoltaic generation. The TE-125K is designed for 480 V wye distribution interconnection and is suitable for
behind-the-meter industrial and commercial PV plants. The unit is a natural evolution of the TE-100K platform,
sharing its power stage topology with an uprated output stage.
Nameplate — AC Output
Nameplate AC output power (continuous) 125 kW
Maximum AC output power (short-term, 10 s) 132 kW
Nominal AC output voltage 480 V, 3-phase, 4-wire (wye + neutral)
AC voltage operating band 422 V – 528 V
Nominal AC frequency 60 Hz
Frequency operating band 57.0 – 62.0 Hz
Continuous AC output current 150.4 A per phase
Maximum AC output current 158.8 A per phase
Power factor Unity nominal; adjustable 0.80 lead / 0.80 lag
Current THD at rated output < 3.0 %
Grid connection type Three-phase, four-wire + PE (wye)
Utility isolation Non-isolated (transformerless)
