Standard Listings & Certifications
The TE-125K holds the following standard listings as evaluated by a Nationally Recognized Testing Laboratory
(NRTL).
(cid:127) UL 1741-SB — Inverters, Converters, Controllers and Interconnection System Equipment for Use With
Distributed Energy Resources (base listing to Supplement SB, evaluated to grid-support utility-interactive
requirements)
(cid:127) UL 1741 — parent standard
(cid:127) IEEE 1547-2018 — DER interconnection and interoperability
(cid:127) IEEE 1547.1-2020 — conformance test procedures
(cid:127) CSA C22.2 No. 107.1-16
(cid:127) FCC Part 15, Subpart B, Class A
(cid:127) IEC 62109-1 / IEC 62109-2 — product safety
The TE-125K's UL 1741-SB listing evaluates the unit as a grid-support utility-interactive inverter under
Supplement SB. The base Supplement SB listing does not include an evaluation to Supplement SB's Power
Control System mode; that mode is a separate, additional evaluation and is not carried by the TE-125K. The
TE-125K product family is not evaluated to UL 3141.
Warranty
Standard 10-year product warranty. Extended 20-year and 25-year warranty tiers available.
